+## Board publication
+
+A board's `public_url` is `null` until it is published. Anyone with the link can view the board, its columns, and its published cards without signing in. Drafts, comments, and uploaded files aren't shared. Publishing doesn't change who can access the board through the regular account URL.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes a board. Only account admins and owners with access to the board can publish it. Returns `201 Created` with the updated board JSON and a `Location` header pointing to `/public/boards/:key`. Publishing again while the board is public keeps the same link.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes a board. Only account admins and owners with access to the board can unpublish it. Returns `204 No Content`. The public board, column (`/public/boards/:key/columns/:id`), and card (`/public/boards/:key/cards/:number`) links stop working. Republishing creates a new link.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
